WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:05.330
Foundation Researcher Marcus Hernandez was
a professional in all aspects of his job.

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:10.100
He was intelligent, being scouted for a job
at the Foundation right out of college.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:15.540
He was brave, unyielding in the faces of the
horrifying creatures and dangerous situations

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:18.340
that working with the anomalous practically
guaranteed.

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:22.590
But most importantly, Researcher Hernandez
was cautious.

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:26.530
He not only knew that keeping his hands at
a fair distance from any newly discovered

00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:31.640
anomalous objects was a safe way to keep his
head, he was also aware that it was sometimes

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:36.789
better to take risks that would further his
knowledge about an anomaly and how best to

00:00:36.789 --> 00:00:38.399
contain it.

00:00:38.399 --> 00:00:42.510
Sometimes those risks came with a price, like
being a part of the first team to study a

00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:44.589
recently discovered anomaly.

00:00:44.589 --> 00:00:49.320
To Researcher Hernandez, it was better to
lose the lives of the ones working to protect

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:55.039
humanity from what lies in the dark than have
any unsuspecting civilians stumble upon something

00:00:55.039 --> 00:00:56.770
potentially life threatening.

00:00:56.770 --> 00:01:03.539
That’s why he and his team took the assignment
of studying SCP-1437 before anyone else in

00:01:03.539 --> 00:01:05.190
the Foundation was able to.

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:10.299
They simply were not sure of what it was capable
of, and their Researcher Hernandez’s known

00:01:10.299 --> 00:01:15.380
attention to detail and cautious nature could
best help the Foundation not only establish

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:20.780
proper containment procedures, but also ensure
that their own personnel were safe while doing

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:21.780
so.

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:25.890
As Researcher Hernandez sat in the back of
a jeep that rolled and tumbled over the arid

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:31.549
landscape of the Mojave Desert, he reviewed
what the Foundation knew about the anomaly.

00:01:31.549 --> 00:01:33.340
Unfortunately, it wasn’t much.

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:39.270
For starters, it was a 3 by 3 meter hole in
the ground, originally thought to be an ordinary

00:01:39.270 --> 00:01:40.270
cave.

00:01:40.270 --> 00:01:45.009
As a result of its deceiving appearance, the
anomaly went unnoticed for decades until the

00:01:45.009 --> 00:01:49.659
Foundation picked up on a local story that
was the talk of the town for a small group

00:01:49.659 --> 00:01:52.009
of camping and hiking hobbyists in Nevada.

00:01:52.009 --> 00:01:57.659
A camper, while out exploring and trekking
through the dry dunes of the Mojave, was struck

00:01:57.659 --> 00:01:59.929
in the back of the neck with a US quarter.

00:01:59.929 --> 00:02:05.140
While the object by itself is harmless, it
came flying at the camper’s body at an incredibly

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:10.060
high speed, shooting from a large hole in
the ground and striking hard enough to break

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:13.690
the skin and wedge itself inside the camper’s
neck.

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:18.350
After reaching the local hospital and getting
the coin removed, it still left a small scar

00:02:18.350 --> 00:02:20.650
across the back of the camper’s head.

00:02:20.650 --> 00:02:26.360
This unusual event prompted Foundation reconnaissance,
which turned out to be entirely warranted,

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:30.940
as observation of the surrounding area found
several more objects buried around the area

00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:36.190
that were believed to have emerged from the
hole now designated as SCP-1437.

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:42.450
A small canoe, decorated with luminescent
patterns, a calculator that added and subjected

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:47.900
letters instead of numbers, and a rotten apple
core were all objects strewn across the immediate

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:53.660
area, and if that’s not strange enough,
attempts to map out the hole failed, as all

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:57.430
measuring equipment was lost after reaching
a certain depth.

00:02:57.430 --> 00:03:03.260
Before the initial observation team packed
up and left, SCP-1437 shot out large quantities

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:08.900
of rock and dirt for over an hour, confirming
that objects emerged from the hole at high

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:09.900
speeds.

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:14.220
Chemical analysis of the objects found around
the area showed that they were composed of

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:20.270
materials either unknown or not commonly found
on Earth to warrant use in mass production.

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:27.150
The observation team came up with a hypothesis
- SCP-1437 was a hole that led to a parallel

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:32.370
universe, and the objects it shot out originated
in said location.

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:36.490
Researcher Hernandez knew that this was just
a hypothesis, but he had reviewed the lab

00:03:36.490 --> 00:03:38.250
results himself.

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:42.530
Those objects certainly did not come from
anywhere on Earth, and if the hole functioned

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:47.480
as a gateway between worlds, that could explain
why the measuring equipment was lost after

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:48.800
a certain point.

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:53.900
The jeep came to a stop, and when Researcher
Hernandez stepped out, he came face to face

00:03:53.900 --> 00:04:00.340
with SCP-1437, a large hole sitting in the
Mojave desert.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:04.700
His crew was already hard at work, surveying
and excavating the surrounding area for any

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:08.710
other objects the hole had shot out that had
been lost to time.

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:13.360
A mobile analysis lab tent was set up in the
distance, as well as several trailers for

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:15.650
personnel living on-site.

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:20.209
Researcher Hernandez’s personal decision
to not use D-Class personnel in his research

00:04:20.209 --> 00:04:25.920
meant that each risk the SCP-1437 team took
had to be calculated differently.

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:30.470
They wouldn’t send a person into the hole
and risk loss of life when a drone could serve

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:33.890
the same function without the potential drawbacks.

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:37.980
But still, the initial observation team lost
all of their equipment while trying to measure

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:41.060
SCP-1437’s depth.

00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:45.430
Why waste an expensive drone when the result
would most likely turn out the same?

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:50.661
It was these decisions that earned Hernandez
fame and respect at the Foundation, and over

00:04:50.661 --> 00:04:57.600
the next few weeks, his team was able to develop
a wide knowledge base regarding SCP-1437 and

00:04:57.600 --> 00:05:02.620
establish safe containment procedures to keep
the anomaly hidden from the public and easy

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:04.980
to work with for Foundation personnel.

00:05:04.980 --> 00:05:11.240
First, a two meter tall electric fencing unit
was built around the perimeter of SCP-1437.

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:16.700
This fence would not only keep unwanted trespassers
out, but also had defensive capabilities due

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:21.330
to the harmful electric charge it could emit
upon contact with an object.

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:25.520
Groups of three security guard personnel were
assigned to patrol this fence at all times,

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:29.850
and they were instructed to deal with any
trespassers through standard Foundation protocol.

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:37.170
They were to be taken into custody, interrogated,
and so long as they were unaware of SCP-1437’s

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:41.790
anomalous properties, given a healthy dose
of amnestics and released back into the general

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:42.930
public.

00:05:42.930 --> 00:05:48.400
Anything that emerged from SCP-1437, be it
a physical object or a living organism would

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:53.070
be catalogued by the Foundation and tested
immediately for any potential hazards before

00:05:53.070 --> 00:05:55.210
further analysis could begin.

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:59.600
If found to be safe, the items would be studied
as much as possible.

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:04.400
If not, they were stowed away in an area intended
to keep them contained until a safe way to

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:06.230
examine them was found.

00:06:06.230 --> 00:06:10.490
But perhaps the most important containment
procedure Researcher Hernandez established

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:15.090
was the forbiddance of testing with SCP-1437.

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:19.330
Due to the anomaly’s mysterious nature and
the incredibly likely potential connection

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:25.110
to parallel universes, testing could have
grave and unforeseen consequences.

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:30.470
When dealing with alternate or parallel timelines
or realities, the Foundation is incredibly

00:06:30.470 --> 00:06:35.900
cautious, and only interacts in ways they’re
absolutely sure will not have any unexpected

00:06:35.900 --> 00:06:38.320
damage on baseline reality.

00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:43.180
That, and Researcher Hernandez wasn’t exactly
keen on attracting the attention of these

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:48.070
parallel universes without a solid understanding
of who and what they were.

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:52.370
As he would come to find, this inclination
proved to be beneficial.

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:58.720
As the team observed SCP-1437, they documented
a number of notable objects that emerged from

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:02.800
the hole, each supposedly originating from
a parallel world.

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:06.600
The first of which, however, was not anything
the team hadn’t seen before.

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:12.420
The initial observation team sent to test
whether SCP-1437 was actually anomalous had

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:15.480
observed the hole emitting a mass of rock
and dirt.

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:22.270
For over an hour, SCP-1437 spewed earthen
materials without stopping, filling the surrounding

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:23.740
areas with debris.

00:07:23.740 --> 00:07:28.949
Since this was before the research team theorized
the hole was connected to parallel realities,

00:07:28.949 --> 00:07:30.639
they weren’t sure what to make of it.

00:07:30.639 --> 00:07:31.639
Was it a natural eruption?

00:07:31.639 --> 00:07:36.830
A poorly documented earthquake that somehow
sent chunks of rock and dirt to the surface

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:38.430
and shooting out of the hole?

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:44.639
Though somewhat stumped, Researcher Hernandez’s
team eventually came to a single, solid conclusion:

00:07:44.639 --> 00:07:51.150
If SCP-1437 led to a parallel world or worlds,
whoever was on the other ‘side’ of the

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:54.370
hole may have been attempting to fill it using
natural materials.

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:58.889
If they were attempting to fill it, could
they be trying to contain it?

00:07:58.889 --> 00:08:03.979
Did the parallel world on the other side of
SCP-1437 have its own Foundation?

00:08:03.979 --> 00:08:09.110
This sudden thought gave Researcher Hernandez
pause, and made him reconsider his hands-off

00:08:09.110 --> 00:08:12.060
approach to SCP-1437.

00:08:12.060 --> 00:08:14.960
Should his team attempt to contact whoever
was on the other side?

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:20.190
If it was a parallel branch of the Foundation,
this behavior would be encouraged.

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:24.330
The Foundation communicated with alternate
versions of itself in time and space all of

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:25.330
the time.

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:28.949
The Department of Temporal Anomalies was built
around this premise.

00:08:28.949 --> 00:08:33.869
But these were exceptions, not the rules,
and communication with alternate Foundations

00:08:33.869 --> 00:08:37.089
was always carried out with utmost safety
and precaution.

00:08:37.089 --> 00:08:41.469
It was only done when there was certainty
that risk would be avoided.

00:08:41.469 --> 00:08:45.449
Researcher Hernandez was sure he made the
correct decision, and he would stray away

00:08:45.449 --> 00:08:50.699
from attempting to contact those on the other
side of the anomaly, even if they were another

00:08:50.699 --> 00:08:54.300
world’s incarnation of the SCP Foundation.

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:58.869
Weeks later, Researcher Hernandez was awoken
in the middle of the night by an excited assistant,

00:08:58.869 --> 00:09:05.670
who, after calming herself down, informed
him that SCP-1437 had spat out a new object.

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:09.319
You have to forgive her, if you were out in
the desert for weeks staring at a hole waiting

00:09:09.319 --> 00:09:14.119
for it to do something and it eventually did
it, you’d be pretty excited too.

00:09:14.119 --> 00:09:18.119
When Researcher Hernandez ran outside to see
what the team was freaking out about, he could

00:09:18.119 --> 00:09:20.110
have jumped for joy too.

00:09:20.110 --> 00:09:24.339
SCP-1437 wasn’t spitting out rocks and dirt
anymore.

00:09:24.339 --> 00:09:30.040
This time, it was a map, clearly illustrated
to depict the continent of North America.

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:34.910
But upon closer inspection, the team noticed
some very apparent differences from a traditional

00:09:34.910 --> 00:09:37.170
map and the geography of our world.

00:09:37.170 --> 00:09:42.459
The map was written entirely in Spanish, and
the names of countries and states it listed

00:09:42.459 --> 00:09:44.329
didn’t match their existing counterparts.

00:09:44.329 --> 00:09:49.660
In fact, the entire borderlines of the map
were mismatched, out of place, and radically

00:09:49.660 --> 00:09:52.120
different from anything resembling North America.

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:57.790
It listed the government of the entire continent
of North America as “La República Popular

00:09:57.790 --> 00:10:02.899
de Aguas Nuevas”, or when translated to
english, “The People’s Republic Of New

00:10:02.899 --> 00:10:03.899
Waters”.

00:10:03.899 --> 00:10:09.089
This exciting find was logged and archived,
and was only the first of a series of objects

00:10:09.089 --> 00:10:12.329
that emerged from SCP-1437.

00:10:12.329 --> 00:10:15.240
A few days later, another object was documented.

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:17.449
This time, it was a photograph.

00:10:17.449 --> 00:10:22.149
After initial scans determined the object
to be safe to view, not harboring any dangerous

00:10:22.149 --> 00:10:26.829
memetic triggers upon viewing or anything
of that nature, the team analyzed the picture

00:10:26.829 --> 00:10:28.899
to the best of their abilities.

00:10:28.899 --> 00:10:34.910
They saw a breathtaking vista of a city skyline,
unlike anything possible on this world.

00:10:34.910 --> 00:10:39.310
Intertwined with buildings were massive structures
that appeared to be made of coral.

00:10:39.310 --> 00:10:43.929
They wrapped around skyscrapers, branching
from the ground and sometimes emerging from

00:10:43.929 --> 00:10:45.749
the buildings themselves.

00:10:45.749 --> 00:10:51.459
The coral broke through the tops of the tallest
buildings, putting the manmade titans to shame.

00:10:51.459 --> 00:10:56.089
In the far background, a massive flying creature
can be seen, peacefully floating through the

00:10:56.089 --> 00:10:57.089
air.

00:10:57.089 --> 00:11:02.629
This otherworldly visual overwhelmed the team,
but after the initial shock wore down, a keen-eyed

00:11:02.629 --> 00:11:07.270
junior researcher pointed out that many of
the buildings resembled known landmarks, though

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:10.119
they were radically altered in noticeable
ways.

00:11:10.119 --> 00:11:16.380
This wasn’t just any city, it was New York
City, only this time with coral and giant,

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:18.100
floating creatures!

00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:21.040
Exactly what the Big Apple’s been missing
this entire time.

00:11:21.040 --> 00:11:24.839
But this was still comprehensible and understandable
for the Foundation.

00:11:24.839 --> 00:11:29.459
SCP-1437’s true weirdness was still yet
to come.

00:11:29.459 --> 00:11:36.290
A few days after the photograph emerged, SCP-1437
shot out a truly peculiar find.

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:41.649
Researcher Hernandez and his team were stumped
as to what its purpose was, and what it signified,

00:11:41.649 --> 00:11:46.290
but they determined the objects to be completely
safe, and archived them regardless.

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:51.499
The items in question were a series of disks
made from solid gold, varying in size but

00:11:51.499 --> 00:11:53.800
never being obscenely large.

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:58.470
Accompanying the discs was a sheet of paper
that read “PLEASE SEND MORE RAIN”.

00:11:58.470 --> 00:12:01.180
The Foundation was understandably puzzled.

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:05.589
One working theory Researcher Hernandez put
together was that whoever was on the opposite

00:12:05.589 --> 00:12:11.829
side of SCP-1437 was paying tribute to the
hole as a form of worship, and was asking

00:12:11.829 --> 00:12:17.050
the almighty beings on the other side to send
more rain, for whatever reason.

00:12:17.050 --> 00:12:21.239
While the Foundation didn’t exactly send
the rain over themselves, whoever sent that

00:12:21.239 --> 00:12:26.119
request was probably pleased when a thunderstorm
the next week sent torrents of rainwater into

00:12:26.119 --> 00:12:28.179
SCP-1437.

00:12:28.179 --> 00:12:29.500
We hope they’re happy.

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:35.309
The most notable discoveries that emerged
from SCP-1437 occurred over a multi-year period.

00:12:35.309 --> 00:12:41.309
Previously, the research team theorized that
SCP-1437 was connected to a single reality,

00:12:41.309 --> 00:12:45.079
and that whoever was on the other side of
it was sending objects through, either by

00:12:45.079 --> 00:12:47.779
chance or by means of communication.

00:12:47.779 --> 00:12:53.190
This discovery proved that there wasn’t
just one parallel world connected to SCP-1437,

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:54.350
but many.

00:12:54.350 --> 00:12:56.440
An unknown amount, in fact.

00:12:56.440 --> 00:13:00.959
The items in question this time weren’t
just objects, but human cadavers.

00:13:00.959 --> 00:13:06.589
One by one over the years, interspaced between
the various oddities that SCP-1437 also spat

00:13:06.589 --> 00:13:10.209
out, were human corpses, dead on arrival.

00:13:10.209 --> 00:13:15.980
The bodies were clad in Foundation-issue D-Class
uniforms, though with some slight variations.

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:23.139
This proved that the worlds connected to SCP-1437
were, in fact, alternate versions of the Foundation.

00:13:23.139 --> 00:13:28.829
Or at least some of the worlds, as there was
no way to tell who, what, or where the objects

00:13:28.829 --> 00:13:32.870
that emerged from SCP-1437 came from.

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:36.839
Researcher Hernandez and his team examined
the bodies with care, and determined that

00:13:36.839 --> 00:13:41.619
they were dead long before they hit the ground,
and that the gateway between worlds triggered

00:13:41.619 --> 00:13:45.290
the cause of death as they traveled between
realities.

00:13:45.290 --> 00:13:49.170
Inside the D-Class jumpsuits, the team discovered
pieces of paper.

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:55.670
Manuscripts that detailed their world’s
Foundation’s documentation on SCP-1437.

00:13:55.670 --> 00:13:59.970
This deliberate inclusion of documentation
signaled to the research team that there was

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:04.999
an attempt at communication and cooperation
from one world’s Foundation to theirs.

00:14:04.999 --> 00:14:06.139
But why?

00:14:06.139 --> 00:14:09.149
The first body was clearly in adequate physical
condition.

00:14:09.149 --> 00:14:14.110
It was protected due to being clothed in a
pressure suit with an attached oxygen supply.

00:14:14.110 --> 00:14:18.939
The documentation read similarly to the SCP
Foundation’s documentation, though instead

00:14:18.939 --> 00:14:25.489
of Special Containment Procedures and an object
class, SCP-1437 was given a “Safety Rating”

00:14:25.489 --> 00:14:27.959
and “Safety Containment Procedures”.

00:14:27.959 --> 00:14:31.910
These detailed a Foundation that was giving
civilians tours of their anomalies, where

00:14:31.910 --> 00:14:36.779
they could take photographs and even get close
enough to view the anomaly from a close distance.

00:14:36.779 --> 00:14:41.509
The rest of the file was similar to what Hernandez’s
team recorded, and listed the following objects

00:14:41.509 --> 00:14:45.100
as those that emerged from SCP-1437:

00:14:45.100 --> 00:14:47.769
One small pyramid composed of concrete.

00:14:47.769 --> 00:14:49.680
Large quantities of dirt and rocks.

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:52.679
A landscape painting, believed to be of a
location in Scotland.

00:14:52.679 --> 00:14:57.910
(According to the painting, its originating
universe's sun is blue and its sky yellow.)

00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:00.290
Several disks made from solid gold.

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:05.079
(Accompanying the disks was a sheet of paper
reading 'PLEASE STOP PLAGUE'.)

00:15:05.079 --> 00:15:06.970
A photograph of several scientists.

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:12.309
(All scientists pictured have unusually long
fingers, estimated to be nearly twenty-five

00:15:12.309 --> 00:15:13.470
(25) centimeters long.)

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:17.420
A sheet of paper reading "THANK YOU PLEASE
SEND MORE GIFTS."

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:22.689
The file continued with a notice explaining
that the bodies of “orange jumpsuited individuals”

00:15:22.689 --> 00:15:26.089
holding documentation of the anomaly emerged
from the hole.

00:15:26.089 --> 00:15:30.839
The file’s unfamiliarity with the jumpsuits
indicate that this world lacks a concept of

00:15:30.839 --> 00:15:31.899
D-Class personnel.

00:15:31.899 --> 00:15:37.819
The file mentions that “On the 15th of August
2012, a volunteer from the Foundation, Marco

00:15:37.819 --> 00:15:44.309
Perton, entered SCP-1437 wearing safety gear,
taking with him a copy of this document.”

00:15:44.309 --> 00:15:49.290
The second D-class body examined by Hernandez’s
team was branded with the phrase “PROPERTY

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:51.589
OF THE SCP CORPORATION”.

00:15:51.589 --> 00:15:55.589
The file described an item with a threat level
of “little”, and a Foundation that was

00:15:55.589 --> 00:15:58.379
more focused on profit than containment.

00:15:58.379 --> 00:16:02.499
After objects emerged from the hole, they
were authorized to be sold to any interested

00:16:02.499 --> 00:16:03.869
collectors.

00:16:03.869 --> 00:16:06.489
Objects described by this version of the Foundation
include:

00:16:06.489 --> 00:16:11.749
A statue of what is believed to be a reptilian
entity sporting numerous eyes and tails.

00:16:11.749 --> 00:16:13.660
Large quantities of dirt and rocks.

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:15.490
A glass bottle of water.

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:16.490
A human femur.

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:17.839
(Covered in saliva.)

00:16:17.839 --> 00:16:21.889
A cube composed of several smaller cubes,
all of which are different colours.

00:16:21.889 --> 00:16:23.239
(Purpose unknown.)

00:16:23.239 --> 00:16:24.239
A soccer ball.

00:16:24.239 --> 00:16:26.429
(Ball only has five sides.)

00:16:26.429 --> 00:16:31.660
The file included the SCP corporation describing
D-Class showing up, as they did in the other

00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:36.470
worlds, and then the Corporation happily sending
several D-Class of their own through the hole

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:40.139
in an attempt to communicate with whoever
was on the other side.

00:16:40.139 --> 00:16:44.279
The third D-Class body examined was heavily
bandaged and appeared to be blinded.

00:16:44.279 --> 00:16:49.220
There were lacerations on its arms and legs,
and its tongue had been removed.

00:16:49.220 --> 00:16:52.889
The file described a Foundation akin to a
religious cult.

00:16:52.889 --> 00:16:58.480
SCP-1437 was given a “Heathen Level” of
“Unforgivable”, and its “Holding Measures”

00:16:58.480 --> 00:17:03.050
described a High Priest having to bless the
hole every two years, and the need to perform

00:17:03.050 --> 00:17:06.409
blood sacrifices into it to ward off any demons.

00:17:06.409 --> 00:17:13.459
This wild incarnation of the Foundation interpreted
SCP-1437 as a portal to the underworld, and

00:17:13.459 --> 00:17:15.241
described a list of objects emerging from
it.

00:17:15.241 --> 00:17:17.470
It read as follows:

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:19.689
Several disks made from solid gold.

00:17:19.689 --> 00:17:23.909
(Accompanying the disk was a sheet of paper
reading 'PLEASE KILL FOES'.)

00:17:23.909 --> 00:17:25.690
Large quantities of dirt and rocks.

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:30.460
(Believed to be an attempt by demons to harm
the High Priest, who was present at the holding

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:31.909
site at the time.)

00:17:31.909 --> 00:17:33.909
The broken remains of a human arm.

00:17:33.909 --> 00:17:35.389
(Covered in saliva.)

00:17:35.389 --> 00:17:38.380
A photograph of a metal bird flying away from
a city.

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:41.789
What appears to be a large mushroom is visible
behind the bird.

00:17:41.789 --> 00:17:44.720
(Believed to be attempt by demons at mocking
us.)

00:17:44.720 --> 00:17:47.070
A human eye which moved when touched.

00:17:47.070 --> 00:17:48.760
(Believed to be a lesser demon.

00:17:48.760 --> 00:17:50.299
Was burnt immediately.)

00:17:50.299 --> 00:17:56.750
Unlike the other worlds, when this one received
D-class through SCP-1437, the religious fanatics

00:17:56.750 --> 00:18:01.309
believed the bodies to be demons wearing the
skin of men, and threw the bodies back in

00:18:01.309 --> 00:18:02.309
the hole.

00:18:02.309 --> 00:18:06.640
The next D-Class body observed by Hernandez’s
team was the most curious.

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:11.130
It was a heavily emaciated child, who had
apparently been lobotomized.

00:18:11.130 --> 00:18:15.390
It described a Foundation that sounds more
like an organization out of a dystopian science

00:18:15.390 --> 00:18:17.720
fiction novel than anything else.

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:22.770
The file spoke of a group of beings referred
to as “Our Masters Above All”, which the

00:18:22.770 --> 00:18:24.760
Foundation answered to.

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:29.580
Any objects emerging from SCP-1437 were brought
before the Masters.

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:33.289
Any trespassers were interrogated by the Masters.

00:18:33.289 --> 00:18:39.159
This Foundation believed the objects SCP-1437
shot out were gifts for the masters.

00:18:39.159 --> 00:18:41.220
Their list read as follows:

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:42.559
One (1) diamond.

00:18:42.559 --> 00:18:44.559
Large quantities of dirt and rocks.

00:18:44.559 --> 00:18:47.340
Bark from the extinct Quercus buckleyi.

00:18:47.340 --> 00:18:49.279
The lower half of a human body.

00:18:49.279 --> 00:18:52.460
(Delivered to supervising Servant of Our Masters
Above.

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:56.830
It is currently unknown how the gift-sender
was aware of the diet of Our Masters Above.

00:18:56.830 --> 00:19:02.419
A document was sent into SCP-1437 thanking
the gift-giver for the object and requesting

00:19:02.419 --> 00:19:04.910
further tributes to Our Masters Above.)

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:07.250
A bottle of human-intended wine.

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:12.360
While they certainly enjoyed the food of the
human body, the wine was clearly misinterpreted.

00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:16.650
For whatever reason, this Foundation interpreted
the wine as an assassination attempt on the

00:19:16.650 --> 00:19:18.200
Masters Above All.

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:23.910
As a result, they sent a large, anomalously
powered explosive through SCP-1437 and into

00:19:23.910 --> 00:19:26.649
the world of an unsuspecting Foundation.

00:19:26.649 --> 00:19:31.600
The file continues with a notice from this
Foundation’s O5-1, which reads: “This

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:36.500
is a reminder of why we must be vigilant in
our containment procedures.

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:40.440
From now on, I don't want any of these 'gifts'
being taken out of containment.

00:19:40.440 --> 00:19:44.090
They are a clear and present danger to Our
Masters Above.”

00:19:44.090 --> 00:19:48.690
Looks like Researcher Hernandez had the correct
idea about not wanting to risk experimenting

00:19:48.690 --> 00:19:51.519
with SCP-1437.

00:19:51.519 --> 00:19:55.610
Attracting the attention of a reality where
the almighty O5 Council answers to an even

00:19:55.610 --> 00:19:58.950
more powerful, human-eating group of Masters
Above All?

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:00.659
No thank you!

00:20:00.659 --> 00:20:04.720
This reality’s Foundation is perfectly content
alone.

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:11.669
Now go check out SCP-1322 - Glory Hole and
SCP-3001 - Red Reality for more anomalous

00:20:11.669 --> 00:20:12.820
Parallel Universe-related SCPs!

